API Documentation 

API Overview 

The application uses RESTful APIs developed using Express.js to facilitate communication between the React frontend and MongoDB database. All protected APIs require JWT authentication through the Authorization header. 

Base URL 

http://localhost:5000/api 

Authentication Header 

Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN> 

 

4.1 Authentication APIs 

Login User 

Endpoint 

POST /api/auth/login 

Description 

Authenticates a registered user and generates a JWT token. 

Request Body 

{ 

"email": "manager@gmail.com", 

"password": "123456" 

} 

Success Response 

{ 

"token": "eyJh...", 

"user": { 

"_id": "12345", 

"name": "Gaurav Joshi", 

"email": "manager@gmail.com", 

"role": "Manager" 

} 

} 

Error Response 

{ 

"message": "Invalid Credentials" 

} 

Status Codes 

200 - Success 

400 - Invalid Credentials 

500 - Server Error 

 

4.2 Dashboard APIs 

Get Dashboard Statistics 

Endpoint 

GET /api/dashboard 

Description 

Returns project and task statistics for the dashboard. 

Headers 

Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN> 

Success Response 

{ 

"totalProjects": 5, 

"totalTasks": 42, 

"todoTasks": 15, 

"inProgressTasks": 10, 

"doneTasks": 17 

} 

Status Codes 

200 - Success 

401 - Unauthorized 

500 - Server Error 

 

4.3 Project APIs 

Get All Projects 

Endpoint 

GET /api/projects 

Description 

Fetches all projects accessible to the logged-in user. 

Headers 

Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN> 

Success Response 

[ 

      { 

"_id": "101", 

"title": "JIRA Project", 

"description": "Task Management System", 

"members": [] 

       } 

] 

 

Get Project By ID 

Endpoint 

GET /api/projects/:id 

Example 

GET /api/projects/101 

Description 

Returns details of a particular project. 

Success Response 

     { 

"_id": "101", 

"title": "JIRA Project", 

"description": "Task Management System", 

"members": [] 

     } 

 

Create Project 

Endpoint 

POST /api/projects 

Access 

Manager Only 

Request Body 

{ 

"title": "JIRA System", 

"description": "Project Management Application" 

} 

Success Response 

{ 

"message": "Project Created Successfully" 

} 

Validation 

Title Required 

Description Required 

 

Delete Project 

Endpoint 

DELETE /api/projects/:id 

  

Access 

Manager Only 

Example 

DELETE /api/projects/101 

Success Response 

{ 

"message": "Project Deleted Successfully" 

} 

 

Add Member To Project 

Endpoint 

POST /api/projects/:projectId/add-member 

Access 

Manager Only 

Request Body 

{ 

"email": "employee@gmail.com" 

} 

Success Response 

{ 

"message": "Member Added Successfully" 

} 

Error Response 

{ 

"message": "User Not Found" 

} 

 

4.4 Task APIs 

Get Tasks By Project 

Endpoint 

GET /api/tasks/:projectId 

Example 

GET /api/tasks/101 

Description 

Returns all tasks belonging to the selected project. 

Success Response 

[ 

      { 

"_id": "501", 

"title": "Create Login Page", 

"status": "Todo", 

"priority": "High" 

      } 

] 

 

Create Task 

Endpoint 

POST /api/tasks 

Access 

 

Manager Only 

Request Body 

{ 

"title": "Create Login Page", 

"description": "Design login form", 

"priority": "High", 

"dueDate": "2026-09-30", 

"project": "101", 

"assignedTo": "301" 

} 

\Success Response 

{ 

"message": "Task Created Successfully" 

} 

Validation 

Title Required 

Description Required 

Assigned User Required 

 

Update Task 

Endpoint 

PUT /api/tasks/:id 

Example 

PUT /api/tasks/501 

Request Body 

{ 

"status": "In Progress" 

} 

Allowed Status Values 

Todo 

In Progress 

Done 

Success Response 

{ 

"message": "Task Updated Successfully" 

} 

 

Delete Task 

Endpoint 

DELETE /api/tasks/:id 

Access 

Manager Only 

Example 

DELETE /api/tasks/501 

Success Response 

{ 

"message": "Task Deleted Successfully" 

} 

 

4.5 Authentication and Authorization 

JWT Authentication Flow 

User Login 

↓ 

Credentials Verification 

↓ 

JWT Token Generated 

↓ 

Token Stored in localStorage 

↓ 

Axios Request Interceptor 

↓ 

Authorization Header Added 

↓ 

Request Sent to Backend 

↓ 

Token Verification 

↓ 

Access Granted 

 

User Roles 

Manager 

Create Project 

Delete Project 

Add Members 

Create Tasks 

Delete Tasks 

Assign Tasks 

Update Tasks 

View Dashboard Statistics 

Employee 

View Assigned Projects 

View Assigned Tasks 

Update Own Task Status 

 

4.6 Common API Error Responses 

Unauthorized Access 

Response 

{ 

"message": "Not Authorized" 

} 

Status Code 

401 Unauthorized 

 

Validation Error 

Response 

{ 

"message": "Title and Description are required" 

} 

Status Code 

400 Bad Request 

 

Resource Not Found 

Response 

{ 

"message": "Project Not Found" 

} 

Status Code 

404 Not Found 

 

Internal Server Error 

Response 

{ 

"message": "Internal Server Error" 

} 

Status Code 

500 Internal Server Error 

 

API Security Features 

JWT Authentication 

Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) 

Protected Routes 

Axios Request Interceptors 

Centralized Error Handling 

Input Validation 

Authorization Middleware 

 